window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Vivace has committed murder to help his country win a war. But will he ever be able to live with himself? How can he have a normal life after such a heinous deed? And surely, no one could ever love a monster like him…</p> <p><i>The Wolfman’s Heart</i> is a short story set in the world of Nathal. It is part of the Bearers of Hope collection of short stories connected to the upcoming Brimwood series by Anne J. Hill.</p> <p>This also contains an excerpt from Brimwood and <i>Thorn Tower</i> (a book set in the same world but in a different time period).</p>"; 
